 "description": "Check housing affordability in a market. Returns mortgage rate, median price, monthly payment, required income, and HUD limits. Optionally specify metro (e.g., \"Denver\"). The inputs are official statistics on DIFFERENT cadences \u2014 a weekly mortgage rate against a quarterly median price \u2014 so the monthly payment is an illustrative ratio of published figures, not a live quote. `freshness` states the span and the age of each input.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "examples": [
   {
    "state_code": "CO"
   },
   {
    "metro_name": "Denver",
    "state_code": "CO"
   }
  ],
  "properties": {
   "_blsKey": {
